      "id": 18,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 30
      },
      "options": {
        "content": "### Replication Rules\n\n| Rule | Source | Target | Entries | Condition |\n|------|--------|--------|---------|----------|\n| **R1** robot-image-1fps | Edge `robot` | Cloud `robot` | `image` | `$each_t: 1s` (1 fps) |\n| **R2** robot-medium | Edge `robot` | Cloud `robot` | all | Medium severity events |\n| **R3** robot-high | Edge `robot` | Cloud `robot` | all | High severity + 5 min context |\n| **R4** robot-telemetry | Edge `robot` | Cloud `robot` | `imu, tf, diagnostics` | `$each_t: 1s` (1 Hz) |\n\n> R2 and R3 filter on AI / sensor labels (`event_severity`, `obstacle_dist_cm`, `battery_pct`, `cpu_temp_c`) that are populated by downstream analytics pipelines.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "transparent": true
    }
